<h1>Kahramaa Project: Comprehensive Architectural Reference Document</h1>
<p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Estimates based on project description for Qatar’s national electricity & water utility (~2.9M population, ~2M smart meters). Replace with actual numbers from your deployed environment.</p>

<h2>1. Source Types Breakdown (Estimated)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Source Type</th><th>Systems / Examples</th><th>Ingestion Method</th><th>Estimated Daily Records</th><th>Estimated Daily Volume (Raw)</th></tr>
<tr><td>Real‑time Streaming</td><td>IoT smart meters (electricity/water), grid sensors</td><td>Azure Event Hubs / IoT Hub → Databricks Structured Streaming</td><td>~192 million</td><td>~150 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Batch (High‑frequency)</td><td>Oracle ERP, MySQL CRM</td><td>ADF Copy Activity (hourly)</td><td>~5 million</td><td>~20 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Batch (Daily)</td><td>Flat files (CSV/XML), meter logs</td><td>ADF pipelines (daily)</td><td>~500,000</td><td>~10 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Batch (Weekly/Monthly)</td><td>Billing cycles, financial summaries</td><td>ADF (weekly/monthly)</td><td>~50,000</td><td>~5 GB</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Total raw ingestion per day:</strong> ~185 GB &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Per month:</strong> ~5.5 TB &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Per year:</strong> ~65 TB</p>

<h2>2. ADF Pipelines – Estimated Count & Categories</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Category</th><th>Number</th><th>Example Names</th></tr>
<tr><td>Ingestion – Batch</td><td>12</td><td><code>pl_ingest_oracle_erp</code>, <code>pl_ingest_mysql_crm</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Ingestion – Streaming</td><td>2</td><td><code>pl_stream_eh_to_bronze</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Orchestration</td><td>6</td><td><code>pl_orch_bronze_to_silver</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Post‑processing</td><td>4</td><td><code>pl_vacuum_optimize</code>, <code>pl_refresh_pbi_dataset</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Error Handling / Monitoring</td><td>3</td><td><code>pl_quarantine_reprocess</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td><strong>27</strong></td><td></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3. ADLS Gen2 Containers (Estimated)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Container</th><th>Layer</th><th>Monthly Growth</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>landing</code></td><td>Transient raw</td><td>~5.5 TB</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>bronze</code></td><td>Append‑only Delta</td><td>~4 TB</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>silver</code></td><td>Cleaned Delta</td><td>~2 TB</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>gold</code></td><td>Star schema Delta</td><td>~1 TB</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>quarantine</code></td><td>Failed records</td><td>~50 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>logs</code></td><td>Pipeline logs</td><td>~20 GB</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>4. Database Objects – Synapse SQL Pool (Gold Layer)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Object Type</th><th>Estimated Count</th><th>Examples</th></tr>
<tr><td>Tables</td><td>45</td><td><code>FactElectricityUsage</code>, <code>DimCustomer</code>, <code>DimMeter</code></td></tr>
