</table>

<h2>7. Synapse SQL Pool – Estimated Configuration</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Pool name</td><td><code>sql_kahramaa_gold</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Service Level</td><td>DWU500c (scalable to DWU1000c)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Distribution</td><td>Hash on <code>customer_id</code> for facts, replicate small dims</td></tr>
<tr><td>Indexing</td><td>Clustered columnstore for facts</td></tr>
<tr><td>Backup / DR</td><td>Geo‑redundant storage, snapshots every 8 hours</td></tr>
</table>

