<p><strong>Key dimensions:</strong> <code>DimCustomer</code> (~3M rows, SCD Type 2), <code>DimMeter</code> (2M), <code>DimDate</code> (~7k), <code>DimLocation</code> (50k), <code>DimTariff</code> (~100).</p>

