<p><strong>How to replace estimates with actual numbers:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>ADF pipelines:</strong> ADF Studio → Author → Pipelines</li>
<li><strong>Synapse object counts:</strong> Run <code>SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sys.tables</code> etc.</li>
<li><strong>Cluster configs:</strong> Databricks workspace → Compute → each cluster’s JSON</li>
<li><strong>Data volumes:</strong> Azure Monitor → Log Analytics → ADF/Databricks logs</li>
</ul>

